- action(n1, "start the buyer process"): Hallucinates an initial step not documented in the source; the text explicitly states "the first step is to visit the Amazon.com Marketplace."
- action(n7, "end"): Hallucinates an action node preceding termination; the source only states "Finally, the process ends," which should connect directly to end(e1) without an intermediate activity.
- actor(a_default, "Default", [...]): Incorrectly labels the participant as "Default" instead of "buyer," failing to faithfully reflect the responsibility assignment in the source ("For the buyer, the first step is...").